## Project Identity

- **Service:** GovOS AI & Geo Intelligence Service
- **Language:** Python 3.12
- **Framework:** FastAPI 0.111.x
- **AI SDK:** google-genai (Vertex AI / Gemini API)
- **Geo:** GeoPandas + Shapely + pyproj
- **Async DB:** asyncpg (PostgreSQL — read-only)
- **Message Queue:** Redis (aioredis — publish SLA events)
- **Search:** opensearch-py (document search)
- **Port:** 8000

