## Package Structure Law

```
app/
  ├── main.py                   ← FastAPI app factory + lifespan
  ├── config.py                 ← Pydantic Settings (env vars)
  ├── api/
  │   ├── deps.py               ← Shared dependencies (auth, db, rate limit)
  │   └── routes/
  │       ├── ai.py             ← /api/v1/ai/* routes
  │       ├── geo.py            ← /api/v1/geo/* routes
  │       └── allocation.py     ← /api/v1/allocation/* routes
  ├── core/
  │   ├── ai/
  │   │   ├── gemini_client.py  ← Singleton Gemini client
  │   │   ├── function_tools.py ← Auto-Function Calling tools
  │   │   └── prompt_manager.py ← Load prompts from /prompts/
  │   ├── geo/
  │   │   ├── ward_resolver.py  ← GPS → Ward polygon resolution
  │   │   └── osm_client.py     ← OpenStreetMap + GeoJSON fetching
  │   └── allocation/
  │       ├── workload_balancer.py ← Officer assignment algorithm
  │       └── sla_monitor.py    ← SLA breach detection + Redis publish
  ├── models/                   ← Pydantic v2 schemas (request/response)
  ├── prompts/                  ← .txt or .md prompt files
  │   ├── classify_complaint.txt
  │   ├── summarize_document.txt
  │   ├── ward_summary.txt
  │   ├── officer_coaching.txt
  │   └── detect_duplicates.txt
  └── services/                 ← Business logic (called by routes)
```

