## Route Table

| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/classify` | Internal | Classify complaint category + priority |
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/chat` | JWT | AI governance assistant chat |
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/summarize` | JWT | Summarize document or complaint thread |
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/ward-summary` | Internal/Scheduled | Generate daily ward narrative |
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/detect-duplicates` | Internal | Semantic duplicate detection |
| POST | `/api/v1/ai/officer-coaching` | JWT (ADMIN) | Officer performance coaching |
| GET | `/api/v1/geo/resolve-ward` | Internal | GPS → Ward + Constituency resolution |
| GET | `/api/v1/geo/ward-boundaries` | Internal | GeoJSON ward boundary fetch |
| POST | `/api/v1/allocation/assign` | Internal | Assign complaint to optimal officer |
| GET | `/api/v1/allocation/workload` | Internal | Current workload distribution |
| GET | `/health` | Public | Service health check |

---

## Forbidden Patterns

- ❌ `import openai` or any non-Google AI SDK
- ❌ Writing to PostgreSQL — read-only access only
- ❌ Hardcoded prompts in Python files — always load from `/prompts/`
- ❌ Passing raw PII (Aadhaar, phone numbers) to Gemini API
- ❌ Synchronous DB calls (`psycopg2`) — use `asyncpg` only
- ❌ Returning un-paginated large result sets from function tools
- ❌ HTTP calls without timeout (default: 30s for AI, 10s for internal services)
- ❌ Global mutable state — use FastAPI dependency injection

